=== regex ignorecase with class
text:
  ABC abc
cursor: 1,1
set: ignorecase
keys: /[a-c]\{3}<CR>
--- vim 9.1
expect-text:
  ABC abc
expect-cursor: 1,5
expect-mode: normal
